  "ST_meta_PlanningBoard_CagnalisOrder": {
    "pb_cag_cagnalirobots": "Apparently, these models are more than a bit fiercer than their SWAT and police counterparts.\r\n\r\nDoesn�t matter, they�re all going to the same place � the scrapyard.",
    "pb_cag_cagnaliarmy-fail": "As Nasara loves to put it: �THAT WAS A COMPLETE FIASCO.�\r\n\r\nI don�t really know the first thing about this Servo kid, but he better pull us out of this fucking mess.",
    "pb_cag_detectives": "As if these assholes couldn�t be a bigger thorn in my side, now they got an android army at their disposal. They�re getting bold and we�re getting ran through all over town. FUCK!",
    "pb_cag_armyupgrade": "Been putting this off long enough as it is. It�s high time we got our boys some proper iron. That should make Touchdown happy � guy�s got a hard-on for lead spitters.",
    "pb_cag_priceriches": "Cagnali Industries has been cutting into our profit margins pretty damn heavily ever since they showed up. I think we deserve a little reimbursement.",
    "pb_cag_uplink": "Cagnali�s setting up her tech bullshit in the city? In MY city? No, no, no, fuck that! Bringing in her robot army is one thing, but setting up shop in historical neighborhoods is something else entirely. I mean, I used to do drugs in that motel!\r\n\r\nServo says this is the base of the robots� hive-mind. Well, let�s go in and give it a lobotomy.",
    "pb_cag_strangedream": "DO NOT TOUCH!!\r\n\r\nNote: Call my chemist and ask him what the fuck he�s cooking!",
    "pb_cag_sheriffandrobots": "Fucking Sheriff couldn�t get the job done himself, so now he�s relying on Cagnali to pick up the slack.\r\n\r\nOn the one hand, it means he�s desperate, which is good. On the other, it means he�s willing to take some extreme measures. And if swapping out half of the Rockay PD with metal monsters ain�t drastic, I don�t know what the hell is.",
    "pb_cag_lostarmy": "Honestly, how else was that supposed to go? Breaking into the Rockay PD� THE FUCK WAS SERVO THINKING!?!",
    "pb_cag_cagnalievidence": "I could�ve guessed it. Cagnali�s planning to take over the city using its own police force. Fuck� IT�S GENIUS. I�d have done the same thing myself if I wasn�t in such poor standing with the local authority.\r\n\r\nThe obvious difference here is that I would turn Rockay into a scumbags� paradise. Cagnali, on the other hand, is gonna make this town a robotic, dystopian hellscape.\r\n\r\nNOT GONNA HAPPEN.",
    "pb_cag_cagnalikill": "I do not like this woman.",
    "pb_cag_emp": "I don�t know where the hell we got the money to afford some military sci-fi bullshit like this, but hey, if it messes with those damn robots, you won�t hear me complaining.",
    "pb_cag_massproduction": "If these machines of Cagnali�s go into full production, we�re gonna run out of bullets before she runs out of her metal men. On top of that, I doubt we�ll see a lot of recruitment given our current �situation�.\r\n\r\nTo sum it all up: either her factory goes up in flames, or we do.",
    "pb_cag_attackchopper": "It ain�t cheap, but the good stuff never is.",
    "pb_cag_servo": "Knows too much about our business. Find and kill him? Recruit? Figure out later. For now, we need him � his inside knowledge from working at Cagnali Industries is all we have to go off of at this point.\r\n\r\nNot to mention his technical expertise; doubt anyone around here could work with the advanced stuff we�re going up against. I sure as hell can�t. So yeah, we�re stuck with the faceless fucker.",
    "pb_cag_policerobots": "Mean, clean, fighting machines. These things being in the possession of the police is basically my worst nightmare, but if I could get my hands on one, I�d take it, too.\r\n\r\nKey takeaway: DON�T try to fistfight.",
    "pb_cag_cyberstorm": "Mine and Cagnali�s best guys going head to head. It�s sure to be one hell of a bloodbath.",
    "pb_cag_cagnaliindustries": "Moved up from screwdrivers to humanoid foot soldiers. It�ll take a lot of guts and a lot of luck to take down this monolith.\r\n\r\nThe only way to bring down the castle with impenetrable walls is from the inside.\r\n\r\nSidenote: Baker Industries has a nicer ring to it.",
    "pb_cag_cagnaliarmy": "Nice outfits, looks cool. Won�t stop some 12-guage buckshot to the face though.",
    "pb_cag_cagnali": "One of the richest people in the country, maybe the world. And also, one of the smartest. Combine extreme wealth with extreme intelligence, a bit of evil and a big splash of control freak, and you got real recipe for disaster.\r\n\r\nShe may think she�s doing good for the world but she only does what�s good for her. A she-devil with an angel face.\r\n\r\nWhy are the pretty ones always crazy?",
    "pb_cag_scudosspreading": "SOB�s are spreading like cancer and now Rockay City�s about to go terminal.",
    "pb_cag_servocomm": "Sounds like a 12-year-old. Also, took a listen to his �music� � nothing but fucking noise � no chance it�ll ever catch on. Kid�s talented at the tech shit, he should stick with that.",
    "pb_cag_hacking": "Sure hope whatever we find is scandalous. Illicit photos, unsavory text messages� plans for a coup of the local government, whatever.\r\n\r\nFind some dirt on an esteemed woman like Cagnali, and she�s bound to squirm.",
    "pb_cag_freearmy": "These guys got themselves stuck in the shit and now it�s up to us to pull them out. What the fuck do I pay them for?!",
    "pb_cag_spreadarmy": "Well� guess there�s nothing left to do but throw whatever we�ve got left at this bitch. Good.\r\n\r\nOpen air, head-to-head, anything-goes street warfare. I�m about to go Napoleonic on her ass.",
    "pb_cag_factoryhq": "What an ugly hunk of concrete. If I had the plastic to do it, I�d just blow the whole damn building down.",
    "pb_cag_policestation": "You know, when I got into this game, I was just boosting cars and slinging dope. Spent the better part of my life trying to avoid ending up in the police station, successfully for the most part.\r\n\r\nAnd now I find myself planning to break into one� funny how life comes full circle like that, ain�t it?"
  },
  "ST_meta_PlanningBoard_GoldCup": {
    "pb_goldcup_basementready": "Alright, we�re fucking ready.\r\n\r\nGet out of the crates in the basement. Override security measures in the control room. Disable the security and open the cages. Then we- GET. THAT. GOLD.\r\n\r\nAnd vanish like goddamn Houdini�",
    "pb_goldcup_cemetery": "Can�t believe this shit. King�s influence over Rockay can be felt even after his chair blew up. Seems like Dragon found him a cozy place to rest in peace, under a fake name and with heavy security. Well, he won�t be in peace for much longer � 'cause we really need that hand of his.\r\n\r\nI ain�t no grave-robber, but a boss' gotta do what he�s gotta do.\r\n\r\nI�m sure as hell glad he didn�t get cremated.",
    "pb_goldcup_trucks": "Can�t use regular trucks, gotta have strengthened suspension and shit. �Least that�s what Gloves tells me. Might be he�s just shakin' me for money, that old dog.\r\n\r\n�Gotta ask Nasara about it.",
    "pb_goldcup_crates": "God knows what they usually ship in these crates, but this time it�ll be us. We get in, get transported right through the security check-ups and then take over the depot from the inside.\r\n\r\nNow I ain�t saying it�ll be easy, but if it ain�t goddamn beautiful.\r\n\r\nSure as hell hope there�ll be enough oxygen.",
    "pb_goldcup_gliders": "Hope nobody on my crew�s afraid of heights. I sure as hell ain�t! Most of the time.\r\n\r\nGotta buy a few gliders, silently fly to the depot�s roof and boom � easy access.\r\n\r\nThe timing�s gonna have to be precise. The guards are gonna change shifts and leave the doors open for a little while � a window big enough for us to enter the depot with no trouble.",
    "pb_goldcup_roofready": "It�s time. Everything�s ready to pull the most stylish heist in history of Rockay.\r\n\r\nWe fly to the roof just as the guards are changing shifts. Sneak inside and override the security in the control room. Disable electricity and shit. Open cages, get the gold, and get the fuck out.\r\n\r\nHere�s hopin' everything goes smooth�",
    "pb_goldcup_c4": "I�m fucking tired of buzzsaws and drills. Wish we could just blow shit up, get the loot and scram.\r\n\r\nLuckily we�ll need a fuck-ton of explosives for this job. If shit goes south, we�ll have to use these �un-elegant� tools, as Nasara would say.",
    "pb_goldcup_king": "King's dead. What else to say?\r\n\r\nI�m coming after everything he had. And I�ll take it all.\r\n\r\nBlack market commerce. Drug deals. Politics. He had every dirty motherfucker in this town stuffed in his pocket. And now his seat�s getting cold � waiting for my ass to sit on it.",
    "pb_goldcup_dragon": "King�s lapdog, Eduardo Reyes, aka Dollar Dragon.\r\n\r\nA tough guy, gotta hand it to him. Held down his crew even after King died and got himself a juicy piece of the pie.\r\n\r\nSomeone I�ll have to crush, one way or another.\r\n\r\nBack in the day he was this badass gangster, led his people with fury and passion. But after the dust of King�s conquest settled, he got comfortable and overly cautious. Means he became a pussy.\r\n\r\nI think it�s time for a new generation to take over Rockay City.",
    "pb_goldcup_hand": "King�s really had everything under his thumb. Literally.\r\n\r\nPolice. Mayor. City council. Heads of crime syndicates.\r\n\r\nEven government-controlled buildings let the doors wide open for him.\r\n\r\nLike that ancient king � everything he touched turned to gold. But that�s alright. I�ll be there soon, too.",
    "pb_goldcup_gold": "Mine. Mine, mine, mine, mine, mine.\r\n\r\nAll the cool dudes had it � Al Capone and other great guys. And I�m gonna be up there with them once I get this city under my thumb.\r\n\r\nAnd this gold�s gonna help me do it.",
    "pb_goldcup_sheriff": "Now I like a pile of gold same as the next crook, but slowing down this asshole will be a nice bonus.\r\n\r\nSheriff wants to parade the gold in DC to show off how he�s faring here in Rockay - and get some more money for his department. That�d be trouble, we got enough cops as is.\r\n\r\nHow embarrassing it�ll be when we steal it right under his nose? Can already hear this dry-as-dust mother-fucker making excuses on Rockay news.",
    "pb_goldcup_roof": "Now I�m not against cowboying our way inside, but we gotta look at this from every angle.\r\n\r\nOne of them could be through the roof. We�ll send our guy to fix their ventilation � and take a few photos while he�s at it.\r\n\r\nGuard towers, shift changes � anything that�ll help us get inside.",
    "pb_goldcup_meeting": "That fucker, Dragon, invited me for a game of golf.\r\n\r\nI�m not of fan of being too friendly with the opposition, but against Sheriff I�ll need all the hands I can get (or chop off).\r\n\r\nThe goal is pretty clear � get the location of King�s resting place and not get killed in the process.",
    "pb_goldcup_police": "The Rockay PD may call themselves protectors of the law, but they�re just another gang battling over control.\r\n\r\nAnd I ain�t giving way. One way or another, the police will fall in line eventually.\r\n\r\nBut for now, a distraction will do. A good ol' slashing tires should slow them down. A trick I learned in elementary.",
    "pb_goldcup_scanner": "The ol' King�s got his paws everywhere � even in a government-controlled fucking depot. Seems like he used it for his own personal storage. Even had his dirty hand-print saved to override security control.\r\n\r\nThe other top-dog that�s got this privilege is none other than Sheriff. And I ain�t cuttin' off his hand (not now at least).\r\n\r\nGrave-robbing it is, I guess�",
    "pb_goldcup_distraction": "The pigs are spread thin around Rockay as is - courtesy of yours truly. But Sheriff definitely shifted his focus to the depot, afraid to lose his salary raise.\r\n\r\nWe�ll see if he chooses it over the lives of innocent Rockay citizens�\r\n\r\nWe'll have to do this at the same day as the heist. And the crew on it won't be available for a while.",
    "pb_goldcup_main": "This gate looks pretty sturdy. Gotta ram it at full speed to break through.\r\n\r\nThere�s also the security that�ll be ready for us � we�ll be making a hell of a ruckus.\r\n\r\nCareful with the guard towers, might have snipers inside.\r\n\r\nAll in all straight-forward, but fucking loud.",
    "pb_goldcup_depot": "This is it, Fort Knox's (slightly less secure) little brother. And inside � a fortune callin' my name.\r\n\r\nOne access point, an army of guards, high-tech security measures and the Sheriff�s attention. That�s what�s standing between us and the treasure. Outta be a cake-walk.",
    "pb_goldcup_tunnel": "Touchdown will be nagging, but somebody�s gotta put in the physical work and dig out the tunnel right to the depot. And I ain�t working with a shovel, not anymore.\r\n\r\nIt�s gotta be big enough for trucks to come through and stable enough not to fucking bury us.",
    "pb_goldcup_turf": "We need to have this turf before we break into the depot. Digging a tunnel and planning a heist on enemy�s turf can get fucking complicated. Can�t have any surprises � this turf�s gotta be under my control. I�ll be taking it sooner or later anyway.",
    "pb_goldcup_basement": "We noticed some crates going in and out of the depot, just big enough to fit a person. But we�ll need to know the exact crates we can use.\r\n\r\nNasara says he knows a guy � master of infiltration. A goddamn ninja. This ninja will get us all the shipping information.\r\n\r\nThen we just Trojan horse ourselves, right through the front-fucking-door.",
    "pb_goldcup_buzzsaw": "Who the fuck designed these?! Why can�t it go full-throttle without my input?!"
  },
