    "meta_mm_security-harbor_metals_description": "A bustling warehouse seems to be attracting a wealthier clientele. Let�s see what the fuss is about.",
    "meta_mm_compound_description": "A dockhand has tipped us off to some strange ongoings at a facility by the port. With trucks coming and going and heightened security levels, it's clear they're guarding something valuable. Let's uncover what that 'something' might be.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_drugs_description": "A drug deal is taking place near the city�s many canals. Time to be the unexpected third party.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_diamonds_description": "A group of suspicious individuals are lurking near the city�s many canals, preparing to send their latest haul on a boat from the city. We have limited time to take action.",
    "meta_mm_multistore-canal_electronics_description": "A large mall popping with a large variety of expensive items. This is exactly the right time to discover a diverse palette of the finest goods from the inside of your loot bag.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-beach_alcohol_description": "A local restaurant offered to pay us handsomely if we restock their booze supplies as quickly as possible. Say no more � we know just the fellows ready to part with their bottles.",
    "meta_mm_security-harbor_electronics_description": "A local warehouse seems to be stocking in preparation for a new mall�s opening. We should take a look at what they have in store.",
    "meta_mm_bank-default_metals_description": "A mountain of precious metals sleeps in the vault of this local bank. Time to alleviate their burden and make it ours.",
    "meta_mm_robbery-canal_electronics_description": "A new fancy corner shop with plenty of expensive appliances on display, ready to welcome the first burglar with a lockpick and a big back.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-highway_electronics_description": "A pack of gangsters collecting scraps from our recent exploits. Now that the police aren�t breathing on our necks, it�s time to pilfer what we left behind.",
    "meta_mm_robbery-center_electronics_description": "A plain old robbery. Drive to the location, pocket everything that isn�t nailed down, and get out. Fast and simple cash.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-highway_metals_description": "A promising young man we wanted to enlist into our ranks has been seen running around with a rival gang. Well, let�s deliver his rejection letter in person, and punctuate it with bullets.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-harbor_electronics_description": "A rival crew is gathering in the harbor. Let�s pay them a visit and see what they�ve got for us.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-highway_jewelry_description": "A rival gang has stolen from a shop that pays us for protection. Let�s rip it from their cold, dead hands, return it to the former owners and considerably bump their insurance.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-harbor_diamonds_description": "A shiny trail of diamonds led you to the location of this armored truck. Or maybe not. But it makes for a better story.",
    "meta_mm_multistore-center_electronics_description": "A store owner downtown prides himself on his impenetrable security. It almost sounds like a challenge.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-center_jewelry_description": "A transport of expensive jewelry is headed to the town�s various stores. The question is, why wait?",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-cranevan-harbor_money_description": "A transport of legal currency is being moved out of the city for safety due to recent events. All for the sake of some nameless corporation. Let�s teach them how things work in good old Rockay.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-loadingtruck-beach_metals_description": "A truck in the beach area is being loaded with bars of precious metals. Time to join the fun!",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-highway_metals_description": "A warehouse with riches, and unsuspecting security. What more could a person wish for?",
    "meta_mm_loothit-center_alcohol_description": "Alcohol and guns don�t mix too well. A group of our rivals got hold of some vintage bottles. We can take them off their hands and see if they�re still able to shoot straight.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-harbor_jewelry_description": "Ambush and rob the armored truck. There is always something good inside.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-harbor_alcohol_description": "An accounting mistake caused this parcel to be sent to the hideout of our enemies. Time to recover our property, whether they like it or not.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-harbor_metals_description": "An armored truck was forced to stop for minor repairs. Unfortunately for them, our informants can sniff weakness like no one else.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-center_drugs_description": "An exchange of drugs between gangs is about to happen at the disclosed location. We can snatch it early at a seriously discounted price.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-loadingtruck-beach_money_description": "An underpaid security guard let slip the exact time they�ll be loading cash into an armored truck for transport. With bundles of cash packed and assembled for the journey, all we need to do is to change the destination.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-center_money_description": "An unsuspecting piggy bank making its way through the city, ready to be cracked open by the first daring opportunist.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_electronics_description": "Another pack of gangsters, another bag of plundered pickings ready to switch hands.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-beach_jewelry_description": "Apparently, a guy with a metal detector uncovered a small fortune this morning. Yet soon he found out he�s still in Rockay and lost everything to a group of armed thugs. Well, two can play this game.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-center_money_title": "Armored Truck Heist",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-convoy-harbor_money_description": "Armored trucks are transporting cash between local banks. Time to swoop in and pocket whatever we can before things get too hot.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-beach_electronics_description": "As per our informers, a pack of common thieves have been nicking valuables from unsuspecting tourists left and right in the beach district. Let�s show them how the big boys play.",
    "meta_mm_bank-default_money_title": "Bank Robbery",
    "meta_mm_loothit-beach_diamonds_description": "Beaches and diamonds sound like a recipe for paradise, with the minor flaw that you have to mow down several thugs to get to it.",
    "meta_mm_jewelry-default_jewelry_description": "Big fat jewelry store full of expensive bling. Ripe for taking.",
