    "meta_mm_loothit-center_diamonds_description": "It seems that a group of our rivals managed to ambush and rob a transport of gems. Now that they�ve done the hard part for us, let�s teach them a lesson about celebrating early.",
    "meta_mm_security-harbor_drugs_description": "It seems that we have finally narrowed down the location. This is the warehouse where one of your rival gangs has stashed a good portion of their drug supply.",
    "meta_mm_jewelry-default_jewelry_title": "Jewelry Heist",
    "meta_mm_compound_description2": "Just off the main road lies a facility suspected of housing precious metals, cash, or both as a safeguard for the local banks. Your objective: infiltrate the compound and demonstrate to them that no location is beyond the reach of Baker's crew.",
