    "meta_mm_armoredvan-cranevan-harbor_money_title": "Open Market",
    "meta_mm_security-highway_electronics_description": "Our informer was badly wounded when caught snooping around this warehouse. They didn�t think this through, since it�s all the more reason to take a look inside.",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-harbor_drugs_description": "Our rival gang uses this warehouse as their storage. Seems like we should drop by and do an inventory.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_alcohol_description": "Our rivals have struggled to part with these vintage bottles way for too long, and now they�ll pay for their mistake when we sniffed them out.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-harbor_jewelry_description": "Our rivals seriously botched their last hustle and left an unmistakable trail straight to their hideout. We can see what they�ve got for us.",
    "meta_mm_highsecurity-ocean_description": "Our sights are set on a large, heavily-guarded warehouse in the port district. Sure to be chock full of valuables, but the guards aren�t your usual nine-to-five variety, so we�d better prepare.",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-highway_electronics_title": "Overcharged",
