    "meta_mm_securitynight_objective": "Rob the warehouse",
    "meta_mm_bank-default_money_description": "Robbing a bank, and surviving to tell the tale, is the dream of every criminal. The ultimate test of skill.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_electronics_title": "Routine",
    "meta_mm_loothit-highway_electronics_title": "Second Swoop",
    "meta_mm_loothit-harbor_metals_description": "Seems like our rivals made away with sizable loot. This is the last chance to grab a part of their prize before it disappears for good.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-cranevan-harbor_jewelry_description": "Sheriff recently took down a wealthy jeweller with connections to the criminal underworld. Now they�re moving his entire stock to Washington. We should honour him and not let the police have the last laugh.",
    "meta_mm_multistore-canal_electronics_title": "Shopping Spree",
    "meta_mm_multistore-center_alcohol_description": "Small businesses huddled together into a small complex. A key to one is key to all.",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-harbor_alcohol_description": "Sneak into a guarded warehouse under the cover of the night. Who knows what could be inside?",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_alcohol_title": "Solid-Liquid Separation",
    "meta_mm_loothit_objective": "Steal from gangsters",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-cranevan-harbor_diamonds_description": "Steal what you can from this impaired armored truck before other opportunists get the same idea.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_jewelry_description": "Sweep in, take all they have, get out. No funny business.",
    "meta_mm_compound_title2": "The Compound Complex",
    "meta_mm_loothit-harbor_jewelry_title": "The Trail",
    "meta_mm_loothit-highway_drugs_description": "The busy highway seems to captivate certain sorts, and their hideouts are rarely without something good to sell. Be prepared for a fight.",
    "meta_mm_security-highway_alcohol_description": "The management of this warehouse called the police when we tried to enlist them in a potential partnership. Never mind, it will make stealing from them all that much sweeter.",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-highway_drugs_description": "The owners of this warehouse started their own business with illegal substances. We can�t suffer a new player in the town, so we�d better put a solid dent into their stock soon.",
    "meta_mm_policeraid-downtown_description": "The police have seized some illegal goods and arrested the perpetrators. Unless we act quickly, all that juicy loot will be out of our reach soon.",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-highway_alcohol_description": "The security crew of this particular warehouse appears to be understaffed. This can prove to be an opportunity for us.",
    "meta_mm_robbery-canal_alcohol_description": "The target is a shop that specializes in exotic rums, fine wine and exquisite liquors. Postpone all celebrations until you return.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-harbor_drugs_description": "The word on the street is, this particular shipment of forbidden substances changed hands between Rockay�s gangs thrice already, sold for a bigger price every time. You have to know what the deal is.",
    "meta_mm_security-harbor_alcohol_description": "This is the storehouse that serves as a liquor delivery hub for all the local restaurants. Let�s cancel a few orders.",
    "meta_mm_security-highway_drugs_description": "This warehouse appears to be completely normal and blatantly uninteresting. They send out goods of low value and their history is as clean as a whistle. But their trucks are armored and they have an unusually high amount of armed guards on the ready. We suspect there�s more going on than it seems.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-highway_drugs_title": "Tithe",
    "meta_mm_loothit-highway_alcohol_description": "Today�s targets appear to be in possession of a large amount of alcohol. Be prepared, and don�t let the goods be destroyed in the process.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-center_drugs_title": "Trade Cancelled",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-convoy-harbor_metals_title": "Transport of Riches",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_metals_description": "Transporting loot through the city canals has its drawback, as the enterprising fellows sure did find when they dunked half their haul into the water, and spent the better part of the afternoon taking them out before the police catch wind of their situation. Unfortunately for them, you�re ready to drop by once they�re done.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-center_metals_description": "Transports with gold and silver bars were seen coursing through the city. This is the location where you can intercept one.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-canal_diamonds_title": "Trouble in Canals",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-loadingtruck-beach_diamonds_title": "Truck of Jewels",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-center_jewelry_title": "Truck of Trinkets",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-highway_metals_title": "Warehouse Robbery",
    "meta_mm_highsecurity-ocean_title": "Warehouse on Watch",
    "meta_mm_security-highway_metals_description": "We have been neglecting this area of town for a while, and its warehouses must be bursting at the seams. An imbalance ripe for mending.",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-harbor_metals_description": "We paid keen attention to our friends from rival turfs after they pulled off a bank robbery, and this seems to be the warehouse where they�re keeping their spoils.",
    "meta_mm_securitynight-highway_electronics_description": "We used this warehouse to stash our own stolen goods, until they started asking for too much. Now with our business concluded, seems like they�re fair game.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-beach_metals_description": "We were tipped off about a location of a trade deal with precious metals, so we can set an ambush. Do you need more?",
    "meta_mm_multistore-canal_alcohol_description": "When you drove by this store earlier, the goods definitely caught your attention and you promised yourself you�ll return sometime � and the time is now.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-convoy-harbor_diamonds_description": "Who knew there were enough gemstones in Rockay to warrant an entire convoy to transport them? That must be a sight to behold, and you wouldn�t miss it for anything.",
    "meta_mm_loothit-center_metals_description": "Word on the street is our rivals have amassed quite a bulk of gold and silver bricks. Let�s trade them for lead in their bodies.",
    "meta_mm_security-highway_electronics_title": "Worth Our While",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-crashedvan-harbor_money_description": "You managed to get your hands on a bank�s today�s schedule, and have a perfect opportunity to snatch one of their cash transports.",
    "meta_mm_armoredvan-loadingtruck-beach_jewelry_description": "Your insider in a local jewelry store alerted you about a particularly large transport of jewelry leaving their place today. "
