  "ST_qp_Info": {
    "qp_info_screen_title": "Fight for respect",
    "qp_info_stories-extra2": "Finishing an urban legend unlocks the next one in the selection.",
    "qp_info_stories-extra3": "Finishing an urban legend with a three-star rating will unlock the unique character you played as in all its missions.",
    "qp_info_contracts": "Jobs are larger missions that require an initial investment but offer a chance for far greater rewards than if they were encountered on the map.",
    "qp_info_screen_description": "Lead a team of skilled criminals to earn respect and cash, either solo or with friends. Build up your reputation and assemble the ultimate crew for daring heists.\r\n\r\nTest your mettle and leave your mark in Rockay's ruthless underworld!",
    "qp_info_stories-extra1": "Replay urban legends to earn a better score and star rating.",
    "qp_info_shuffle": "Shuffle allows you to test your skills to the fullest in a randomized sequence of missions. Overcome all three and get a hefty bonus on top of the regular mission rewards.",
    "qp_info_screen_start": "Start Multiplayer",
    "qp_info_shuffle-extra1": "The longer tiers come with increased rewards. They are unlocked by successfully completing the previous, shorter tier in a row.",
    "qp_info_stories_extra4": "There is a limited pool of characters for every urban legend, and their revives do not replenish in between missions.",
    "qp_info_contracts-extra1": "They are unlocked by encountering the heist in the campaign, or by completing it with other players in Multiplayer.",
    "qp_info_stories": "Urban Legends are cooperative mini-campaigns that can be played without any limitations with bots and players alike.",
    "qp_info_shuffle-extra2": "You receive rewards for each successful mission you complete, even if you ultimately fail before reaching the end of the round. However, if you are successful, you obtain additional money, rare weapons and score."
  },
